!! Highlight Notes Widget

Review saved article highlights and notes without reopening the article first.

!! Syntax

```
<$highlight-notes tiddler="My Paper" emptyMessage="No saved notes yet." />
```

!! Attributes

|!Attribute |!Type |!Description |
|tiddler |optional|Target literature tiddler. Defaults to the current tiddler |
|emptyMessage |optional|Message shown when there are no saved highlights or notes |

!! Behavior

* The widget reads saved highlight data from `/literature/highlight/<title>`.
* Notes are sorted by their article position.
* Each card shows the highlight category, optional note text, and an excerpt.
* The widget also adds links back to the full article and to the specific highlight anchor when available.